# Image-owned default terminal, materialised into /etc/xdg by
# tmpfiles.d/10-workstation-terminal.conf.
#
# /etc/xdg is an XDG_CONFIG_DIRS entry, so it outranks the xdg-terminal-exec
# package's own fallback list in /usr/share -- including that list's
# "-footclient.desktop" line, because an explicit entry read at higher
# precedence prevents a later fallback exclusion. Overwriting the package file
# instead, which the previous base did, would have discarded its execarg_default
# table along with it.
#
# A user overrides this with ~/.config/xdg-terminals.list, which is read first.
workstation-footclient.desktop
